  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Accountant)\n\n### Bulk Add Users via Excel (Only if no other modules are in use)\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 24 Jul, 2025 at  2:17 PM\n\n\t\tTo begin using Capium 365, it’s essential to correctly configure user access and complete their contact details. Below are the steps to follow for a smooth setup process.\n\nCapium 365\n\nNavigation: Capium 365 > Manage > Import\n\nBegin by clicking on 'Users', then 'Next' to proceed. \n\nYou will now have the option to download a sample Excel file, which serves as a template for uploading user data. This file includes the required format and columns needed for a successful import. \n\nFill in the sample file with the appropriate user information, ensuring all required fields are completed accurately.\nNote:  Refer to the image below for an example of the sample file structure.\n\nOnce the file has been populated, return to the platform to upload it. You can either:\n\nDrag and drop the file into the upload area, or\n\nClick 'Browse' to manually select the file from your device.\n\nNote: You can drag and drop the file or click on browse.\n\nThe system will automatically validate the uploaded data. If there are any issues or missing fields, you will be notified so corrections can be made. \n\nOnce the data has been verified and you're satisfied with the information, click 'Save and Next' to complete the import process.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118596\">Capium 365</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000200518\">Capium 365 (Accountant)</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Bulk Add Users via Excel (Only if no other modules are in use)\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Thu, 24 Jul, 2025 at  2:17 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">To begin using Capium 365, it’s essential to correctly configure user access and complete their contact details. Below are the steps to follow for a smooth setup process.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-